note path-note <name> <note>: replace a path's note. The agent reaches for it to rewrite a path's summary once its steps show what the workflow is, since the note is written for someone who did not see the diff. The path note describes the workflow as a whole for someone who did not see the code; it is usually rewritten once the steps exist.

